{"id":"c57bdf80f8f006ca","group":"27","path":"27/27-df-pbpolynomialextension.md","title":"Multilinear polynomial extension","display":"df-pbpolynomialextension — Multilinear polynomial extension","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications","book_abbrev":"27","label":"27-df-pbpolynomialextension","aliases":["27-df-pbpolynomialextension"],"display":"df-pbpolynomialextension — Multilinear polynomial extension","depends_on":["[[27-df-pbextension]]","[[27-df-pbcoeff]]"],"source_file":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf","source_section":"§13.3.1","source_statement":"Definition 13.7, Equation (13.25)","source_printed_pages":"579–580","source_pdf_pages":"603–604","verification_status":"source-definition-checked"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"27"},{"key":"label","html":"27-df-pbpolynomialextension"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27-df-pbpolynomialextension</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-pbpolynomialextension — Multilinear polynomial extension"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"53f1b3025ce14af2\" href=\"?note=53f1b3025ce14af2\" title=\"27-df-pbextension\">27-df-pbextension</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"7937ecc11ac59760\" href=\"?note=7937ecc11ac59760\" title=\"27-df-pbcoeff\">27-df-pbcoeff</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_file","html":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§13.3.1"},{"key":"source_statement","html":"Definition 13.7, Equation (13.25)"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"579–580"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"603–604"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-definition-checked"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\\in\\mathrm{PseudoBool}_n\">\\(f\\in\\mathrm{PseudoBool}_n\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U_n\">\\(U_n\\)</span>（see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"53f1b3025ce14af2\" href=\"?note=53f1b3025ce14af2\" title=\"27-df-pbextension\">27-df-pbextension</a>），<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c_f\">\\(c_f\\)</span>（see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"7937ecc11ac59760\" href=\"?note=7937ecc11ac59760\" title=\"27-df-pbcoeff\">27-df-pbcoeff</a>），<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N=\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}\">\\(N=\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>待定义扩张记号：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PolExt}\">\\(\\mathrm{PolExt}\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PolExt}(f):U_n\\to\\mathbb R,\\qquad \\mathrm{PolExt}(f)(p)\\coloneqq\\sum_{S\\subseteq N}c_f(S)\\prod_{i\\in S}p_i.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{PolExt}(f):U_n\\to\\mathbb R,\\qquad \\mathrm{PolExt}(f)(p)\\coloneqq\\sum_{S\\subseteq N}c_f(S)\\prod_{i\\in S}p_i.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall p\\in U_n\\;\\forall i\\in N\\;\\forall b\\in[0,1]\\;\\forall j\\in N\\quad (p^{i\\leftarrow b})_j\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}b&amp;j=i,\\\\p_j&amp;j\\neq i.\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall p\\in U_n\\;\\forall i\\in N\\;\\forall b\\in[0,1]\\;\\forall j\\in N\\quad (p^{i\\leftarrow b})_j\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}b&amp;j=i,\\\\p_j&amp;j\\neq i.\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MultiAffine}_n\\coloneqq\\{g:U_n\\to\\mathbb R\\mid\\forall p\\in U_n\\;\\forall i\\in N\\;\\forall t\\in[0,1]\\;(g(p^{i\\leftarrow t})=(1-t)g(p^{i\\leftarrow0})+tg(p^{i\\leftarrow1}))\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{MultiAffine}_n\\coloneqq\\{g:U_n\\to\\mathbb R\\mid\\forall p\\in U_n\\;\\forall i\\in N\\;\\forall t\\in[0,1]\\;(g(p^{i\\leftarrow t})=(1-t)g(p^{i\\leftarrow0})+tg(p^{i\\leftarrow1}))\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 f^{pol} 的规范多项式扩张。系数由 Möbius transform 唯一固定，避免依赖任意 PBNF 表示。MultiAffine 表示分别对各坐标仿射，不等于整个空间上的仿射函数。空积为1，n=0 时多项式只含常数项。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"27-df-pbextension","status":"resolved","id":"53f1b3025ce14af2","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-pbextension]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-pbcoeff","status":"resolved","id":"7937ecc11ac59760","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-pbcoeff]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-pbextension","status":"resolved","id":"53f1b3025ce14af2","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$f\\in\\mathrm{PseudoBool}_n$；$U_n$（see [[27-df-pbextension]]），$c_f$（see [[27-df-pbcoeff]]），$N=\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}$。","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-pbcoeff","status":"resolved","id":"7937ecc11ac59760","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$f\\in\\mathrm{PseudoBool}_n$；$U_n$（see [[27-df-pbextension]]），$c_f$（see [[27-df-pbcoeff]]），$N=\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}$。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"f\\in\\mathrm{PseudoBool}_n","display":false},{"tex":"U_n","display":false},{"tex":"c_f","display":false},{"tex":"N=\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PolExt}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PolExt}(f):U_n\\to\\mathbb R,\\qquad \\mathrm{PolExt}(f)(p)\\coloneqq\\sum_{S\\subseteq N}c_f(S)\\prod_{i\\in S}p_i.","display":true},{"tex":"\\forall p\\in U_n\\;\\forall i\\in N\\;\\forall b\\in[0,1]\\;\\forall j\\in N\\quad (p^{i\\leftarrow b})_j\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}b&j=i,\\\\p_j&j\\neq i.\\end{cases}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{MultiAffine}_n\\coloneqq\\{g:U_n\\to\\mathbb R\\mid\\forall p\\in U_n\\;\\forall i\\in N\\;\\forall t\\in[0,1]\\;(g(p^{i\\leftarrow t})=(1-t)g(p^{i\\leftarrow0})+tg(p^{i\\leftarrow1}))\\}.","display":true}],"bytes":1765,"backlinks":[{"id":"efe2d4b0294be128","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$f\\in\\mathrm{PseudoBool}_n$，$f(\\chi_\\varnothing)=0$；$c_f,\\chi_A$ 经 [[27-df-pbpolynomialextension]] 的上游 [[27-df-pbcoeff]]；$N=\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}$，$U_n$ 经该定义的上游。"},{"id":"5244dbb38da17b8a","anchor":"ref-293","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[27-df-pbpolynomialextension|df-pbpolynomialextension — Multilinear polynomial extension]]"},{"id":"c7ddd9dada5543af","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$f\\in\\mathrm{PseudoBool}_n$；$\\mathrm{PolExt},\\mathrm{MultiAffine}_n$（see [[27-df-pbpolynomialextension]]），$\\beta_p$（see [[27-df-bernoulliproduct]]），规范多项式重构（see [[27-thm-pbpoly]]）。"}],"outgoing":["53f1b3025ce14af2","7937ecc11ac59760"]}